Off: the buffer whose value travels widest drives the white point, as before.\nA counter or a timer travels widest of all, and then the picture drifts.\n\nOn: the buffer whose value follows the light of the game's own frame the\nway an exposure does -- a little behind it, as eyes adapt -- and nothing\nuntil that is sure, which takes about half a minute of walking between\nlight and shade. Timers, frozen values and the frame's own brightness\nare turned down. Paper white is used until then.\n\nAnchors set under one rule may need setting again under the other.\nCosts one small measuring pass a frame. Adapted from janblade's fork.	关：取值变化范围最大的缓冲区驱动白点，与以前相同。计数器或计时器的变化范围最大，画面随之漂移。\n\n开：选择取值像曝光那样跟随游戏自身画面光照的缓冲区——稍有滞后，如同眼睛适应——在确定之前不选任何缓冲区，这大约需要在明暗之间走动半分钟。计时器、冻结的值以及画面自身的亮度会被排除。在此之前使用纸白。\n\n在一种规则下设置的锚点，在另一种规则下可能需要重新设置。每帧额外花费一次小型测量通道。改编自 janblade 的分支。
