Synthesises detail in the upscaler's output, before frame generation sees it.\n\nNeeds two similarly named files beside OptiScaler, one character apart:\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA's model (~165 MB) -- you supply it\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   the forwarder (~115 KB) -- ships in this package\nUndocumented and driven directly, so none of this is officially supported.	在帧生成接收之前，为放大器的输出合成细节。\n\n需要在 OptiScaler 旁边放置两个名称相近、只差一个字符的文件：\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA 的模型（约 165 MB）——需自行提供\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   转发器（约 115 KB）——随本包提供\n未公开文档且被直接驱动，因此以上均无官方支持。
Whether the model's edit is applied. Off shows the clean upscaler frame while the\npass keeps running -- so with Hold frame (under Compare) you can freeze a\nframe and toggle this to see the same frozen frame with and without Neural\nRendering. Leave it on for normal use.	是否应用模型的编辑。关闭时显示干净的放大器画面，但本通道保持运行——因此配合“保持帧”（位于“比较”下）可以冻结一帧，并切换此项来对比同一冻结帧在有无神经渲染时的效果。正常使用时请保持开启。
Before: runs Neural Rendering on the game's render-resolution color, then\nupscales the edited copy. This may reduce GPU cost, but can introduce shimmer\nand unstable detail on moving edges. Compare the picture in motion.\n\nExperimental on D3D12 and the D3D12 bridges. Ray reconstruction, Hold frame,\nthe driver proxy, and unsupported inputs use the after-upscale path.\nChanging render dimensions pauses NR until they stay stable for 500 ms.\nThe original game color is used while the model is being built or skipped.	之前：先在游戏的渲染分辨率颜色上运行神经渲染，再放大编辑后的副本。这可能降低 GPU 开销，但可能在移动的边缘带来闪烁和不稳定的细节。请在运动中对比画面。\n\n在 D3D12 和 D3D12 桥接上为实验性功能。Ray Reconstruction、保持帧、驱动代理以及不支持的输入会使用放大后路径。渲染尺寸改变时 NR 会暂停，直到尺寸稳定 500 ms。模型构建中或被跳过时使用游戏原始颜色。
Default leaves the choice to the model.\n\nNot the same scale as the super resolution or ray reconstruction presets --\nthe same number means something different here.\n\n310.9.16 carries two weight sets: Preset 1 is the original September model,\nPreset 2 the smaller October one, and Default (or any other number) falls back\nto Preset 2. The line below is what the model says it built.	“默认”将选择权交给模型。\n\n与 Super Resolution 或 Ray Reconstruction 预设的编号体系不同——同一个数字在这里含义不同。\n\n310.9.16 带有两组权重：预设 1 是最初的九月模型，预设 2 是较小的十月模型，“默认”（或任何其他数字）会回退到预设 2。下方一行是模型报告的实际构建结果。
