-1 means follow local structure, and is the model's own default -- it is not a\nstrength of zero. 0 and above set skin independently of the rest of the frame.\n\nRead only with the auto skin mask on; with it off the model ignores this.	-1 表示跟随局部结构，这是模型自身的默认值——并不是强度为零。0 及以上会独立于画面其余部分单独设置皮肤。\n\n仅在开启自动皮肤遮罩时读取；关闭时模型会忽略此项。
Lets the model find skin itself rather than treating the frame uniformly.	让模型自行识别皮肤，而不是对整个画面一视同仁。
Freezes the frame the model works on. While held, change paper white, the\nstrengths, the reversible mode, the model preset -- anything below the\nupscaler -- and only that setting moves; the scene does not.\n\nWhat it CANNOT show: DLSS/FSR/XeSS upscaler presets or anything upstream\n(the upscaler is not re-run on a held frame), and the game's own HUD and\npost-processing, which run after this pass and keep updating. The white\npoint stops being measured and holds its value while frozen, so it cannot\ndrift and confound the comparison.\n\nHide the menu and it stays held. Untoggle to resume.	冻结模型处理的帧。保持期间，更改纸白、各项强度、可逆模式、模型预设——放大器之后的任何设置——只有该设置会变化，场景不变。\n\n它无法展示的内容：DLSS/FSR/XeSS 放大器预设或任何更上游的设置（放大器不会对保持的帧重新运行），以及游戏自身的 HUD 和后处理，它们在本通道之后运行并会持续更新。冻结期间白点停止测量并保持当前值，因此不会漂移而干扰对比。\n\n隐藏菜单后仍保持冻结。取消勾选即可恢复。
Where the wipe cuts. Left of it is the frame as the upscaler produced it,\nright of it is the frame the model edited.	滑动对比的分割位置。左侧是放大器生成的帧，右侧是模型编辑后的帧。
Proxy is the picture handed to the model -- if that looks wrong, the white point\nis wrong and nothing downstream can be judged.\n\nDifference shows what the model actually changed, amplified twenty times and\ncentred on grey. A flat grey frame there means it is doing nothing.	代理是交给模型的画面——如果它看起来不对，说明白点不对，下游的一切都无法评判。\n\n差异显示模型实际改变了什么，放大二十倍并以灰色为中心。若画面是一片均匀的灰色，说明模型什么也没做。

