# 2026-09-28: GPU timing, hook method and present options, the colour and exposure-scan help,
# synthesized frame generation, section headers, and the status and failure reasons the NR panel shows.
# Filter names stay in English; they are listed as themselves because every label needs an entry.
Fence-confirmed GPU timing	经 fence 确认的 GPU 计时
Confirmed timing is available on the D3D12 NR path and its bridges. This backend is not instrumented.	确认计时可用于 D3D12 NR 路径及其桥接。此后端未加插桩。
Measure NR on the GPU	在 GPU 上测量 NR
Each published sample belongs to one NR evaluation and one observed queue submission. It is read only after that submission completes and the command-list recording is sealed against replay. No GPU wait is introduced. Unsupported or ambiguous samples are discarded.\n\nThe interval covers GPU commands inside the NR Dispatch, including copies, model calls, composition and resource restoration. Caller-side pre-upscale preparation, the upscaler, and frame generation are outside this interval. Queue elapsed time is not pure kernel busy time.\n\nD3D12 Present and guide capture have independent samples at the same interval. The Present route includes its copies, guide preparation, Dispatch and HDR conversion; CPU waits are excluded. The native Vulkan and D3D11 Present hosts do not have this route bracket.	每个发布的样本对应一次 NR 评估和一次观测到的队列提交。只有在该提交完成、且命令列表录制已封存以防重放后才会读取。不会引入任何 GPU 等待。不受支持或有歧义的样本会被丢弃。\n\n该区间涵盖 NR Dispatch 内的 GPU 命令，包括复制、模型调用、合成和资源恢复。调用方在放大前的准备、放大器本身以及帧生成都不在此区间内。队列耗时并非纯粹的内核忙碌时间。\n\nD3D12 Present 和引导数据捕获在相同间隔下有各自独立的样本。Present 路线包括其复制、引导数据准备、Dispatch 和 HDR 转换；不含 CPU 等待。原生 Vulkan 和 D3D11 的 Present 宿主没有此路线计时区间。
Measurement off. Pending samples may still be retained safely.	测量已关闭。待处理的样本仍可能被安全保留。
Sample every N eligible evaluations	每 N 次符合条件的评估采样一次
The first eligible evaluation is sampled, then every %u evaluations. An evaluation is not necessarily a presentation frame.	采样第一次符合条件的评估，之后每 %u 次评估采样一次。一次评估不一定对应一个呈现帧。
Accepted %llu | discarded %llu | pending %u	已接受 %llu | 已丢弃 %llu | 待处理 %u
No confirmed GPU sample yet.	尚无已确认的 GPU 样本。
Last confirmed sample: %.3f ms dispatch = %.3f ms model + %.3f ms outside model	最近确认样本：%.3f ms dispatch = %.3f ms 模型 + %.3f ms 模型外
Historical sample %llu, %.1f s since recording; %s, model %ux%u, %u passes	历史样本 %llu，录制后 %.1f s；%s，模型 %ux%u，%u 遍
Sample contract %llu, evaluation %llu, run %llu; interval was %u evaluations	样本契约 %llu，评估 %llu，运行 %llu；间隔为 %u 次评估
This is one historical sample, not the current frame or an average. Use matching contracts in the INFO log for comparisons.	这是一个历史样本，不是当前帧也不是平均值。比较时请使用 INFO 日志中相匹配的契约。
Each extra pass processes the previous answer and has its own model history. Cost and VRAM grow. A failed extra pass keeps the last successful answer. Requested passes are not proof of completed work; check the last evaluation and INFO log.\n\nEnabling this after untracked NR has already run requires restarting the application. Retry cannot make earlier GPU work tracked. Unsupported submission paths refuse extra passes.	每增加一遍都会处理上一遍的结果，并拥有自己的模型历史。开销和 VRAM 占用随之增加。额外一遍失败时会保留上一次成功的结果。请求遍数并不能证明工作已完成；请查看上次评估和 INFO 日志。\n\n若在 NR 已经以未跟踪方式运行后再启用此项，需要重启应用程序。“重试”无法让之前的 GPU 工作变为已跟踪。不受支持的提交路径会拒绝额外的遍。
The Model controls above are the master settings. Unchecked overrides inherit their current values. Turning individual settings off or reducing the pass count keeps saved edits.	上方的“模型”控件即为主设置。未勾选的覆盖项会继承其当前值。关闭单独设置或减少遍数会保留已保存的编辑。
on	开启
off	关闭
