The native Vulkan timer is legacy and is not fence-confirmed.\nFor D3D12, use the separate Fence-confirmed GPU timing panel.\nA historical sample is not the current frame's cost.	原生 Vulkan 计时器为旧版，未经 fence 确认。\n对于 D3D12，请使用单独的“经 fence 确认的 GPU 计时”面板。\n历史样本并不代表当前帧的开销。
Source	源
Auto	自动
Upscaled	放大后
Present	Present
Hook method	挂钩方式
Where the pass runs, and what it runs on.\n\nAuto: the swapchain backbuffer, as soon as the game's upscaler has handed over its depth and motion; the upscaler's output until then.\n\nUpscaled: in place, immediately after the game's upscaler has written its output. That output is linear and un-tonemapped, so the Colour section below must map it into something the model recognises -- the paper white is where a game that moves its exposure makes itself felt.\n\nPresent: at the moment of present, on the swapchain's backbuffer -- the frame the game has finished and tone-mapped, which is exactly the kind of picture the model was trained on. There is nothing to divide and no white point to find, and with frame generation the base frame is enhanced before the generated frames are made from it. This is how the ReShade implementations run it, and the one a title like KCD2 wants.\n\nA native Vulkan game ignores this. When the upscaler runs through OptiScaler's D3D12 bridge (a Vulkan or D3D11 game) there is no D3D12 present hook: Auto stays on the upscaler's output and Present runs nothing, except on a D3D11 game, where Present hosts the pass on the bridge's swapchain and takes effect after a restart.	本通道在何处运行、作用于什么。\n\n自动：一旦游戏的放大器交出了深度和运动信息，就在交换链后台缓冲区上运行；在此之前作用于放大器的输出。\n\n放大后：在游戏的放大器写入输出后立即原地运行。该输出是线性的、未经色调映射的，因此下方的“颜色”部分必须将其映射为模型能识别的内容——对于会改变曝光的游戏，纸白正是体现其影响的地方。\n\nPresent：在呈现时，作用于交换链的后台缓冲区——即游戏已完成并经过色调映射的画面，这正是模型训练时所用的那类画面。没有需要除以的数值，也无需寻找白点；启用帧生成时，基础帧会先被增强，再从中生成插帧。ReShade 的实现就是这样运行的，像 KCD2 这样的游戏也需要这种方式。\n\n原生 Vulkan 游戏会忽略此项。当放大器通过 OptiScaler 的 D3D12 桥接运行时（Vulkan 或 D3D11 游戏），不存在 D3D12 Present 挂钩：“自动”停留在放大器的输出上，“Present”不运行任何内容；D3D11 游戏例外，此时“Present”会在桥接的交换链上承载本通道，并在重启后生效。
Require DLSS temporal inputs	要求 DLSS 时间性输入
Present needs the game's depth and motion to reproject its history, and uses them only on the frame they were captured for. With this on, a frame that has none -- none captured yet, or one that cannot be shown to be its own -- is shown as the game rendered it. With it off, the pass runs on dummy temporals -- constant depth, no motion -- and treats the scene as standing still, which is right for a title whose upscaler is not DLSS.	Present 需要游戏的深度和运动信息来重投影其历史，且只在它们所捕获的那一帧上使用。开启时，没有这些数据的帧——尚未捕获，或无法证明属于该帧——会按游戏原本渲染的样子显示。关闭时，本通道使用虚拟时间性数据运行——恒定深度、无运动——并将场景视为静止，这适合放大器不是 DLSS 的游戏。
Synthesized motion	合成运动
Experimental. Only for frames with no motion from the game (no upscaler to take it from). Instead of telling the model nothing moved, the motion is estimated from this frame and the last, so its history follows a moving camera rather than ghosting behind it. The estimate is coarse at thin edges and text and costs a little GPU time; depth stays constant. "No history without motion" below no longer applies to a frame that has it.	实验性。仅用于没有来自游戏的运动信息的帧（没有可提供运动信息的放大器）。不再告诉模型画面没有运动，而是根据当前帧和上一帧估算运动，使其历史跟随移动的镜头，而不是在后面拖出残影。估算在细边缘和文字处较粗糙，并占用少量 GPU 时间；深度保持恒定。对于具有估算运动的帧，下方的“无运动时舍弃历史”不再适用。
Protect the HUD	保护 HUD
Experimental. Pixels that stay exactly the same while the scene around them moves are taken for interface and handed back untouched through the model's own UI correction, so text and HUD lines stay crisp. A HUD is only found once the camera has moved behind it, and it stays protected for about a second and a half after the scene stops. A still, detailed patch next to motion can be taken for HUD; it is then shown as the game drew it.	实验性。周围场景移动时保持完全不变的像素会被视为界面，通过模型自身的 UI 校正原样交还，使文字和 HUD 线条保持清晰。只有镜头在 HUD 后方移动过之后才能识别出 HUD，并且在场景停止后约一秒半内仍受保护。紧邻运动区域的静止且细节丰富的区块可能被误认为 HUD；此时它会按游戏原本绘制的样子显示。
No history without motion	无运动时舍弃历史
Only for frames that run on dummy temporals. The model is told nothing moved, so a moving camera leaves ghosts and doubled edges where things used to be. On, it starts its history over every frame: no ghosts, but none of its temporal smoothing either. Frames with the game's own depth and motion are not affected.	仅用于使用虚拟时间性数据运行的帧。模型会被告知没有任何运动，因此移动的镜头会在物体原来的位置留下残影和重影边缘。开启后，每帧都重新开始历史：没有残影，但也没有时间性平滑。带有游戏自身深度和运动信息的帧不受影响。
Present sync	Present 同步
Waits for the backbuffer write-back to finish before the flip. Frame generation needs it: without it a paced flip can show an unfinished picture. Left on auto it waits only when frame generation could be involved, because otherwise the wait just holds the game back. Ticking or unticking this box forces it either way.	在翻转前等待写回后台缓冲区的操作完成。帧生成需要它：否则按节奏进行的翻转可能显示未完成的画面。设为自动时，仅在可能涉及帧生成时才等待，因为其他情况下等待只会拖慢游戏。勾选或取消勾选此框会强制开启或关闭。
Stage: swapchain present (bypasses upscaler stages)	阶段：交换链 Present（绕过放大器阶段）
Not on this route right now: the game is not running Ray Reconstruction, so "Model resolution" below is what governs. These two take effect if it starts.	当前不在此路线上：游戏未运行 Ray Reconstruction，因此由下方的“模型分辨率”决定。若其开始运行，这两项才会生效。
Above 1x the model supersamples: no new detail, and cost grows with the area. Ray Reconstruction already denoises this frame.	高于 1x 时模型进行超级采样：不会带来新细节，开销随面积增长。Ray Reconstruction 已经对此帧降噪。
Model resolution: set by RR Working scale on this route	模型分辨率：在此路线上由“RR 工作比例”设定
Supersampling %.2fx: the model runs ABOVE native, then\nis sampled back down. Experimental, and costly -- time grows with the area.	超级采样 %.2fx：模型在高于原生的分辨率下运行，然后再采样缩小。实验性功能，开销很高——耗时随面积增长。
The filter that averages the model's above-native answer back to display size --\nthis is what turns supersampling into LESS noise rather than more. Sharper\nfilters (Lanczos3, Kaiser3) keep the most detail; softer ones (Bicubic,\nCatmull-Rom) are gentler on ringing. Independent of the Output Scaling\ndownscaler, so the two can differ and run at the same time.	将模型高于原生分辨率的结果平均缩回显示尺寸的滤波器——正是它让超级采样带来更少而不是更多的噪点。较锐利的滤波器（Lanczos3、Kaiser3）保留最多细节；较柔和的（Bicubic、Catmull-Rom）振铃更轻。它独立于“输出缩放”的缩小器，因此两者可以不同并同时运行。
What fraction of the frame the model works at. Cost falls with the square of\nthis, so half resolution is roughly a quarter of the time.\n\nThe frame is never reduced. Only the model's contribution is computed small\nand enlarged, so the picture underneath is untouched whatever this says.\n\nWhat it trades: the shading the model adds is broad and survives enlargement;\nthe fine structure it synthesises does not, and softens. Worth having when the\npass costs more than you want to pay for the detail it returns.\n\nThe frame itself stays at full detail whatever this says -- only the\nmodel's own work is done small.\n\nauto is full size on RTX 40 and later and half size on RTX 20 and 30: an RTX 3060\nmeasured 25 times an RTX 4090's per-pixel cost. Moving the slider replaces\nit; Auto puts it back.	模型以帧的多大比例进行处理。开销随其平方下降，因此一半分辨率大约只需四分之一的时间。\n\n帧本身从不会被缩小。只有模型的贡献以小尺寸计算再放大，因此无论此值为何，底层画面都不受影响。\n\n代价：模型添加的明暗变化较宽泛，放大后仍能保留；而它合成的精细结构则不能，会变得柔和。当本通道的开销超过你愿意为其返回的细节付出的代价时，值得使用。\n\n无论此值为何，帧本身都保持完整细节——只有模型自己的工作以小尺寸完成。\n\n自动值在 RTX 40 及更新型号上为全尺寸，在 RTX 20 和 30 上为一半尺寸：实测 RTX 3060 的每像素开销是 RTX 4090 的 25 倍。拖动滑块会替换该值；“自动”可将其恢复。
Matched residual, sharp	匹配残差（锐利）
Matched residual + DLSS	匹配残差 + DLSS
How far the frame moves toward the model's picture.\n\nThe model's answer is not added to the frame -- it is a complete picture of its\nown, rescaled so its luminance sits where the original says it should. This\nblends between the two, so both ends are real pictures and everything between\nthem is one too.\n\n0 gives back exactly what the upscaler produced. 1 is the model's picture.\n\nAbove 1 carries on past it in the same direction, which is not something the\nmodel asked for -- use it to see what it is doing, then come back down. This\nis the control to push if you want more effect: Intensity belongs to the model\nand it decides what to do with it.	帧向模型画面靠拢的程度。\n\n模型的结果并不是叠加到帧上——它本身就是一幅完整的画面，经过缩放，使其亮度落在原画面所指示的位置。此项在两者之间混合，因此两端都是真实的画面，中间的每个值也是。\n\n0 原样返回放大器生成的画面。1 即模型的画面。\n\n高于 1 会沿同一方向继续越过它，这并非模型所要求的——用它来观察模型在做什么，然后再调回来。想要更强效果时应调高的是这个控件：“强度”属于模型，由模型决定如何使用。
Whether the model's colour arrives with its light.\n\n0 keeps the game's own hue exactly -- every pixel is the original colour with\nonly its brightness carrying the model's verdict. Game-accurate colour, with\nthe detail. 1 brings the model's colour as well, in its own hue, clamped into\nAP1 so nothing unreachable is asked for.\n\nThis cannot shift hue on its own: it interpolates between two finished\npictures rather than adding a colour difference to one, which is what used to\nlet a warm subject come back green.\n\nAbove 1 it OVER-SATURATES: the colour keeps its hue but grows more vivid,\nand rolls off at the edge of what the display can show rather than clipping\ninto a flat blown patch. 1 is the model's own colour; push past it for punch.	模型的颜色是否随其光照一同带来。\n\n0 完全保留游戏自身的色相——每个像素都是原始颜色，只有亮度承载模型的判断。颜色忠于游戏，同时保留细节。1 也会带来模型的颜色，使用模型自身的色相，并限制在 AP1 内，以免要求无法达到的颜色。\n\n此项本身不会造成色相偏移：它在两幅完成的画面之间插值，而不是给其中一幅加上颜色差值——以前正是那种做法让暖色物体变绿。\n\n高于 1 会过饱和：颜色保持色相但更鲜艳，并在显示器能显示的边缘平滑衰减，而不是截断成一块平涂的过曝区域。1 是模型自身的颜色；超过它可获得更强冲击力。
What the model is shown, and how its answer comes back.\n\nOff (soft knee): the default. It rolls highlights off so hard the model\ncannot resolve detail in them -- fine in soft-lit scenes, weak in bright ones.\n\nNeutwo composed: an unclipped curve so the model sees highlight detail, then\neverything above (Detail/Colour strength, highlight guard, palette). It wins in\nbright scenes, but the curve compresses MIDTONES too, so in soft-lit content it\ncan be worse than Off. It also shifts paper white -- re-check it when you switch.\n\nHybrid composed: the best of both, and the one to use. Identity in the\nmidtones -- as good as Off there -- and the unclipped roll only in the\nhighlights, so it recovers the detail Off crushes without giving up the\nmidtones Neutwo does. It barely shifts paper white.\n\nReplace: the raw model straight back through the exact inverse, none of the\ncomposition -- no guard, no palette, no strengths. Gorgeous where there are no\nbright lights, but they FLASH in motion. A reference, not a daily setting.\n\nHybrid replace: the raw model like Replace, but on the hybrid curve -- the\ndecode is identity in the midtones, so the flashing is confined to genuine\nbright highlights instead of everywhere. Most of Replace's detail, far more\nstable. If you love the Replace look but the flicker bothers you, use this.\n\nOff is byte-identical to before.	模型看到的是什么，以及它的结果如何返回。\n\n关闭（软拐点）：默认值。它对高光的压缩非常强，以致模型无法解析其中的细节——在柔和光照的场景中表现不错，在明亮场景中较弱。\n\nNeutwo 代理 + 合成：一条不截断的曲线，让模型能看到高光细节，然后应用上方的所有处理（细节/颜色强度、高光保护、调色板）。它在明亮场景中胜出，但该曲线也会压缩中间调，因此在柔和光照的内容中可能不如“关闭”。它还会改变纸白——切换时请重新检查。\n\n混合代理 + 合成：两者之长，推荐使用。中间调保持恒等——在那里与“关闭”一样好——仅在高光部分使用不截断的压缩，因此能恢复“关闭”压掉的细节，又不像 Neutwo 那样牺牲中间调。它几乎不改变纸白。\n\n替换：模型的原始结果直接经由精确逆变换返回，不做任何合成——没有保护、没有调色板、没有强度。在没有明亮光源的地方效果极佳，但这些光源在运动中会闪烁。仅作参考，不适合日常使用。\n\n混合代理 + 替换：与“替换”一样使用模型的原始结果，但基于混合曲线——解码在中间调保持恒等，因此闪烁只限于真正明亮的高光，而不是到处都有。保留了“替换”的大部分细节，稳定得多。如果你喜欢“替换”的效果但受不了闪烁，请用这个。\n\n“关闭”与以前逐字节完全相同。
Neural Rendering Model selection (DLSSNR.Style):\n\nModel A (Default): standard reference neural model with default local tone and structure.\n\nModel B (Natural): subtle contrast (-0.25) and saturation (-0.10) compensation. Preserves natural skin tones and softens harsh highlights.\n\nModel C (Cinematic): gentle saturation adjustment (-0.15) for filmic presentation.\n\nTuning changes apply instantly on the live frame with seamless temporal reset.	神经渲染模型选择 (DLSSNR.Style)：\n\n模型 A（默认）：标准参考神经模型，使用默认的局部色调和结构。\n\n模型 B（自然）：轻微的对比度 (-0.25) 和饱和度 (-0.10) 补偿。保留自然肤色并柔化刺眼的高光。\n\n模型 C（电影级）：温和的饱和度调整 (-0.15)，呈现电影感画面。\n\n调整会立即在实时画面上生效，并无缝重置时间性历史。
Holds still parts of the picture still. Where the frame the model was shown did not\nchange, keep what was shown last frame and let the model's new answer in slowly;\nwhere it changed, show the model's answer as it is. Aimed at the model re-deciding\nstill content -- a slope that brightens and darkens with nothing moving.\n\n0 is off and costs nothing. 1 holds a still pixel outright. It stands down on the\nbefore-upscale stage, where the frame is jittered and every pixel moves.	让画面中静止的部分保持静止。在模型看到的画面没有变化的地方，保留上一帧显示的内容，并让模型的新结果缓慢进入；在有变化的地方，按原样显示模型的结果。针对的是模型对静止内容反复重新判断——例如没有任何移动、却忽明忽暗的斜坡。\n\n0 为关闭，没有开销。1 会完全锁定静止像素。在放大前阶段自动停用，因为那里的帧带有抖动，每个像素都在移动。
How far the model's input may drift, relative to its brightness, before a pixel\ncounts as moved. Lower follows subtle lighting changes sooner; higher tolerates\nmore flicker in the input before letting go.	模型输入相对于其亮度可以漂移多少，像素才被视为已移动。较低值会更早跟随细微的光照变化；较高值在放手前容忍输入中更多的闪烁。
Hook method is set to Present: the swapchain backbuffer is already\ntone-mapped and display-referred sRGB. White point and exposure mapping\ncontrols are bypassed.	挂钩方式设为 Present：交换链后台缓冲区已经过色调映射，并且是面向显示的 sRGB。白点和曝光映射控件将被绕过。
The model was trained on finished, sRGB-encoded frames. The upscaler's\noutput is not one: it is linear and open-ended. These decide how it is\nmapped into something the model recognises. A frame the game reports as\nalready tone-mapped is passed over untouched and none of this applies.	模型是在完成的、sRGB 编码的帧上训练的。放大器的输出并非如此：它是线性且无上限的。这些控件决定如何将其映射为模型能识别的内容。游戏报告为已经色调映射的帧会原样跳过，这里的一切都不适用。
Where the number that divides the frame comes from.\n\nPaper white only -- the slider below and nothing else. Right for a\ngame whose exposure never moves, wrong the moment it does: one\nconstant cannot serve a cave and a field.\n\nThe game's own exposure -- read from the texture the game hands\nthe upscaler. The best source there is, because it is decided\nupstream and nothing this pass does can move it. Not every game\nsupplies one.\n\nA buffer the scan found -- for games that compute an exposure and\nnever pass it on. A GUESS: candidates are matched by shape, and in\nGTA V the best one tracks the real exposure but at its own scale,\nwhich the anchor's ratio cancels. Needs anchoring once, and checking\nafterwards.	用于除以帧的数值从何而来。\n\n仅纸白——只用下方的滑块，别无其他。适合曝光从不变化的游戏，一旦曝光变化就会出错：一个常量无法同时适用于洞穴和原野。\n\n游戏自身的曝光值——从游戏交给放大器的纹理中读取。这是最好的来源，因为它在上游就已确定，本通道的任何操作都无法改变它。并非每个游戏都提供。\n\n扫描找到的缓冲区——适用于计算了曝光却从不传递出去的游戏。这只是猜测：候选项按形状匹配，在 GTA V 中最佳的一个能跟踪真实曝光，但有自己的比例，锚点的比值会将其抵消。需要锚定一次，之后再检查。
This game supplies no exposure -- paper white is in use. Try the scan instead.	此游戏不提供曝光值——正在使用纸白。请改用扫描。
This game's exposure is not usable here; paper white is in use.	此游戏的曝光值在这里无法使用；正在使用纸白。
This game supplies an exposure and it is being read.	此游戏提供曝光值，正在读取。
