  (held: absent this frame)	  （保持：本帧缺失）
Nothing in this game is shaped like an exposure.	这款游戏中没有任何类似曝光的内容。
The exposure scan needs a restart: Neural Rendering was off when the game started.	曝光扫描需要重启：游戏启动时神经渲染处于关闭状态。
Watching %u, none moving yet -- go between light and shade.	正在观察 %u 个，目前均未发生变化——请在光照和阴影之间移动。
Found one. Set paper white below until the picture looks right, then press Anchor here.	找到了一个。在下方调整纸白直到画面看起来正常，然后点击“在此处锚定”。
This game supplies an exposure -- the option above would use it.	此游戏提供曝光值——上面的选项会使用它。
