Shows the pass against itself, so the two can be seen at once rather than\ntoggled and remembered.\n\nSide by side puts the whole frame in each half, untouched on the left and\nedited on the right. Both halves are squeezed horizontally to fit, so it is\nfor looking at rather than playing in.\n\nWipe cuts a single frame at the split and resamples nothing, so the picture\nis the right shape and can be played normally. Drag the split below; it is a\nstored setting and stays put once the menu is closed.\n\nNeither needs the menu open to keep working. A hairline marks the join.	将经过本通道和未经本通道的画面同时显示，无需来回切换、凭记忆比较。\n\n并排：每一半都显示完整的帧，左侧未处理，右侧已编辑。两半都被水平压缩以适应屏幕，因此只适合观看，不适合游玩。\n\n滑动对比：在分割线处切开同一帧，不做任何重采样，因此画面比例正确，可以正常游玩。拖动下方的分割线；它是保存的设置，关闭菜单后保持不变。\n\n两种方式都不需要菜单保持打开。接缝处有一条细线标记。
Writes which side is which onto the frame itself, so a screenshot still\nsays so after it has left this machine. Drawn into the picture's own\nplane: in the wipe the split reveals and hides the label exactly as it\ndoes the images, and there is nothing to drag. Swap sides moves the\nlabels with their pictures.	将哪一侧是哪一侧写在画面上，这样截图离开这台机器后仍能看出。标签绘制在画面本身的平面上：在滑动对比中，分割线会像显示和隐藏图像一样显示和隐藏标签，也没有需要拖动的东西。“交换两侧”会让标签随画面一起移动。
Puts the edited frame on the other side.\n\nWorth doing once you have decided which you prefer: the eye is not\neven-handed about left and right, and a difference can read as an\nimprovement purely from where it sits. If the same side still wins after\nswapping, it is the pass you are seeing and not the placement.	将编辑后的帧放到另一侧。\n\n在决定更喜欢哪一侧之后值得这样做：眼睛对左右并非一视同仁，差异可能仅仅因为所在位置而被看成改进。如果交换后仍是同一侧胜出，那么你看到的是本通道的效果，而不是位置的影响。
How much of the frame each half shows.\n\nA half is half as wide as the frame and just as tall, so the frame\ncannot fill it and keep its shape.\n\nAt 1 the whole frame is there at its right proportions, with bars above\nand below. At 2 the half is filled and the sides are cropped away\ninstead. Anything between trades one for the other.	每一半显示帧的多少。\n\n每一半的宽度是帧的一半、高度相同，因此帧无法既填满它又保持比例。\n\n为 1 时显示完整的帧且比例正确，上下有黑边。为 2 时填满这一半，改为裁掉两侧。介于两者之间则在二者间折中。
