Repeats frames instead of interpolating them where the motion breaks up:\nwhile more than this share of neighbouring motion samples disagree and the\nmedian motion exceeds 1%% of the image width (parallax, disocclusion, thin\nobjects over a far background). A uniform pan keeps interpolating at any\nspeed. 25%% is a starting point; lower repeats more. 0 is off	在运动破碎处重复帧而不是插值：当相邻运动样本中不一致的比例超过此值，且运动中位数超过图像宽度的 1%% 时（视差、去遮挡、远处背景前的细小物体）。匀速平移在任何速度下都会继续插值。25%% 是一个起点；数值越低重复越多。0 为关闭
