How far around the detected HUD, in pixels, generated frames show\nthe real frame, to cover the smear beside each element; the outer\nhalf fades out. It covers the smear fully up to this many pixels of\nmotion per base frame. Around the HUD the background then moves at\nthe base frame rate. 0 is the detected HUD alone	在检测到的 HUD 周围多少像素范围内，生成帧显示真实帧，以覆盖每个元素旁的拖影；外侧一半逐渐淡出。每基础帧运动不超过这么多像素时可完全覆盖拖影。此时 HUD 周围的背景会以基础帧率移动。0 表示仅检测到的 HUD 本身
How the model's work is brought back up when it ran below the frame's size.\n\nClassic composes the model's small picture directly against the full-size\nframe. Those two disagree by the shrink's blur as well as by the model's edit,\nand the composition cannot tell them apart -- it reads the blur as brightness\nthe frame has and the model never saw. The lower the model resolution the\nlarger that error, and it is the colour shift that shows up at half size.\n\nMatched residual carries up only the model's difference and lays it on the\nframe's own proxy, so both pictures being compared are full size and the only\nthing that came from the small raster is the edit itself.\n\nMatched residual, sharp is the same, with the model's difference enlarged by\na sharper filter (Catmull-Rom, held to its neighbours so it cannot ring), so\nmore of the fine structure the model drew at the small size survives.\n\nMatched residual + DLSS hands the model's difference to a private DLSS Super\nResolution, which builds it up over frames and so can return detail finer\nthan the small raster holds. D3D12 only, and it needs nvngx_dlss.dll. Where it\ncannot run -- native Vulkan, before the upscaler, no real depth and motion,\nwhile it starts -- Matched residual runs, and the line below says why.\n\nNo effect at full size or above: there is no residual to carry and all four are\nidentical (supersampling brings its answer down to frame size before this).\n\nFrom hhkbble's multi-pass work on this fork; the DLSS enlargement is wilsjo2's.	模型以低于帧尺寸运行时，如何把它的工作放大回来。\n\n经典：将模型的小画面直接与全尺寸帧进行合成。两者的差异既来自缩小造成的模糊，也来自模型的编辑，而合成无法区分二者——它会把模糊当作帧具有而模型从未见过的亮度。模型分辨率越低，误差越大，这就是在一半尺寸下出现的偏色。\n\n匹配残差：只把模型的差值放大上来，并叠加到帧自身的代理上，因此进行比较的两幅画面都是全尺寸的，唯一来自小尺寸栅格的只有编辑本身。\n\n匹配残差（锐利）：同上，但模型的差值用更锐利的滤波器放大（Catmull-Rom，并受相邻像素约束，不会产生振铃），因此模型在小尺寸下绘制的精细结构能保留更多。\n\n匹配残差 + DLSS：把模型的差值交给一个私有的 DLSS Super Resolution，它跨帧累积，因此可以还原比小尺寸栅格所含更精细的细节。仅限 D3D12，并需要 nvngx_dlss.dll。在它无法运行的情况下——原生 Vulkan、放大器之前、没有真实的深度和运动信息、启动期间——会改用匹配残差，下方一行会说明原因。\n\n模型以全尺寸或更高运行时无效：没有残差可放大，四种方式完全相同（超级采样会在此之前把结果缩回帧尺寸）。\n\n源自 hhkbble 在本分支上的多遍处理工作；DLSS 放大来自 wilsjo2。
