# 2026-10-04: model cadence (docs/dlssnr/design/model-cadence.md): the control, its help, the GPU timing
# kind line and the status line under the control (DlssNr::Cadence::Describe).
Model cadence	模型节奏
Every frame	每帧
Every 2nd frame	每 2 帧
Every 3rd frame	每 3 帧
Every 4th frame	每 4 帧
Allow with frame generation	帧生成时也允许
Runs the model on one frame in N and carries its edit along the game's motion onto the frames in\nbetween. It buys frame rate and costs stability in motion: detail can pop each time the model\nruns again, and what a moving object uncovers can ghost, or show the plain frame, until then.\nFrame times alternate long and short. A still scene looks as it does with every frame.\n\nIt needs the game's own depth and motion, so it stands down before the upscaler, on frames\nwithout them, with Hold frame or a capture, and while frame generation is active unless allowed\nbelow. Off costs nothing.	每 N 帧中只在一帧上运行模型，并沿游戏的运动把其编辑带到中间的帧上。它以运动中的稳定性换取帧率：每次模型重新运行时细节可能跳变，而运动物体新露出的区域在此之前可能出现残影或显示未编辑的画面。帧时间会长短交替。静止场景看起来与“每帧”时完全相同。\n\n它需要游戏自身的深度和运动信息，因此在以下情况下停用：放大器之前、没有这些信息的帧、启用“保持帧”或捕获时，以及帧生成处于活动状态时（除非在下方允许）。关闭时没有开销。
Off by default. Frame generation interpolates between frames whose cost alternates, and DLSS-G\nwas measured unable to pace through that: stutter and flashes that grow with the multiplier and\nthe cadence. Turn it on to measure it, not to play.	默认关闭。帧生成会在开销交替的帧之间插值，经实测 DLSS-G 无法在这种情况下保持节奏：卡顿和闪烁会随倍数和节奏增大。开启它是为了测量，而不是用来游戏。
A carried frame of model cadence %u: no model call, so no model time.	模型节奏 %u 的沿用帧：没有模型调用，因此没有模型耗时。
A model frame of model cadence %u. With an interval that is a multiple of the cadence, every sample is the same kind of frame.	模型节奏 %u 的模型帧。当间隔是节奏的倍数时，每个样本都是同一类帧。
Running the model every 4th frame; the frames between carry its last edit.	每 4 帧运行一次模型；中间的帧沿用其上次的编辑。
