The model runs this frame: a history reset is pending.	本帧运行模型：有待处理的历史重置。
The model runs this frame: its size, format, route or settings changed.	本帧运行模型：其尺寸、格式、路线或设置已更改。
The model runs this frame: the pass did not run for a while.	本帧运行模型：本通道有一段时间没有运行。
The model runs every frame: the pass ran more than once in one present.	每帧运行模型：本通道在一次 Present 中运行了不止一次。
Off: the model runs every frame.	关：每帧运行模型。
The model runs every frame: model cadence is not available on native Vulkan.	每帧运行模型：原生 Vulkan 不支持模型节奏。
