The model runs every frame: this route does not present through OptiScaler's swapchain, so model cadence cannot count frames.	每帧运行模型：此路线不通过 OptiScaler 的交换链呈现，因此模型节奏无法计数帧。
The model runs every frame: model cadence does not run before the upscaler.	每帧运行模型：模型节奏不在放大器之前运行。
The model runs every frame: this frame has no game depth and motion to carry the edit with.	每帧运行模型：此帧没有可用于沿用编辑的游戏深度和运动信息。
