# Peripheral compression (docs/dlssnr/design/peripheral-compression.md)
Peripheral compression	边缘压缩
Centre band	中心带
Packed extent	打包范围
Packed model input	打包的模型输入
Experimental. The model's input is packed denser in the centre than at the edges, so at the\nsame cost the centre keeps full detail and the edges give some up. Its answer is unpacked\nbefore it is composed; the frame itself is untouched.\n\nThe defaults, 80 and 90, cost what a Model resolution of 90 costs, so that is the\ncomparison to make, not 100. Matched residual is used at full model resolution too;\nClassic blurs colour at the edges here.\n\nD3D12, after the upscaler or at present. Not above Model resolution 100 and not with the\ndriver proxy. Moving a slider restarts the model's history; a new packed size rebuilds it\nafter a moment.	实验性。模型的输入在中心打包得比边缘更密，因此在相同开销下，中心保留全部细节，边缘则牺牲一些。其结果在合成前会被解包；帧本身不受影响。\n\n默认值 80 和 90 的开销相当于模型分辨率 90，因此应与之比较，而不是与 100 比较。在模型全分辨率下也会使用匹配残差；此处“经典”会使边缘颜色变模糊。\n\n仅限 D3D12，在放大器之后或 Present 时。模型分辨率高于 100 时不可用，也不能与驱动代理一起使用。移动滑块会重新开始模型的历史；新的打包尺寸会在片刻后重建模型。
How much of each axis, around the middle, the model sees at full density.	每个轴上围绕中心、模型以全密度看到的比例。
How much of each axis the model's input spans, before Model resolution. Everything past the\ncentre is squeezed into the rest, to no less than half its size: this has to be at least\nhalfway between the centre band and 100.	在应用模型分辨率之前，模型输入在每个轴上覆盖的比例。中心以外的部分会被压缩到剩余空间中，但不低于其一半尺寸：因此该值至少要达到中心带与 100 的中点。
Active: the model works at %ux%u for a %ux%u frame, %.0f percent of the pixels it would work on without it.	已启用：模型以 %ux%u 处理 %ux%u 的帧，所处理像素为不启用时的百分之 %.0f。
Not active: %s.	未启用：%s。
Peripheral compression is running, so this applies at full model resolution too.	边缘压缩正在运行，因此在模型全分辨率下也会应用此项。
Packed model input: what the model was handed, edges squeezed, stretched over the frame.	打包的模型输入：模型实际收到的画面，边缘被压缩，拉伸铺满整帧。
the frame is too small to lay out	帧太小，无法布局
