the edges would be squeezed below half their size, which aliases: widen the packed extent or narrow the centre band (packed extent x 2 must be at least 100 + centre band)	边缘会被压缩到其一半尺寸以下，这会产生混叠：请扩大打包范围或缩小中心带（打包范围 x 2 必须至少为 100 + 中心带）
the packed model would be under a quarter of the frame: raise Model resolution or the packed extent	打包后的模型将小于帧的四分之一：请提高模型分辨率或打包范围
