not on the before-upscale stage	不能在放大前阶段使用
not with the driver proxy (UseProxy)	不能与驱动代理一起使用 (UseProxy)
this build has no pack/unpack shader	此构建没有打包/解包着色器
the pack/unpack pass could not be built or run on this device	打包/解包通道无法在此设备上构建或运行
Peripheral compression is running: Matched residual runs.	边缘压缩正在运行：使用匹配残差。
The model runs every frame: model cadence does not run with replace curves.	每帧运行模型：模型节奏不能与替换曲线一起运行。

# Measure detail
Measure detail	测量细节
Measure detail: failed to initialize compute pass	测量细节：计算通道初始化失败
Cancel	取消
Measures NR's output on the scene on screen at the current settings for 60 evaluations, against the game's own frame (ideally with Hold frame on):\n  - Detail: fine band detail added (sigma ~1.2 px vs ~3 px)\n  - Flicker: frame-to-frame output change beyond input change\n  - Colour: saturation change and warmth shift\n  - Shadows: darkening and crushed share\nResults are compared against the previous measurement.	在当前设置下，对屏幕上的场景测量 NR 的输出，共 60 次评估，并与游戏自身的画面对比（最好开启“保持帧”）：\n  - 细节：增加的精细频段细节（sigma ~1.2 px 对比 ~3 px）\n  - 闪烁：超出输入变化的逐帧输出变化\n  - 颜色：饱和度变化与冷暖偏移\n  - 阴影：变暗程度与死黑比例\n结果会与上一次测量进行比较。
Measure detail stopped: this command list cannot be tracked (see the log).	测量细节已停止：无法跟踪此命令列表（见日志）。
