the backbuffer's format is not the swapchain's, so the HDR conversion does not trust its colour space; the frame is shown as the game rendered it	后台缓冲区的格式与交换链不同，因此 HDR 转换不信任其色彩空间；该帧按游戏原本渲染的样子显示
# 2026-10-13: the comparison capture (docs/dlssnr/design/comparison-capture.md): the button, its help and its states.
Capture original and processed	捕获原始帧和处理后帧
Saves the next frame twice, as the pass read it and as the pass wrote it, into the\nretoque-captures folder beside OptiScaler. Each file carries a record of the build, the route,\nthe model and every setting that shapes the picture, and a .json beside them says the same.\n\nA display-referred frame is saved as PNG, a linear HDR frame as PFM (32-bit float). On the\npresent routes it is the finished frame before the menu is drawn; after the upscaler it is the\nupscaler's output, before the game's own tonemapper, post-processing and interface.\n\nThe newest 64 pairs are kept. Dropping a file named dlssnr-capture.trigger beside OptiScaler\nasks for the same capture from outside the game on D3D12 routes.	将下一帧保存两次：本通道读取时的样子和写入后的样子，保存到 OptiScaler 旁边的 retoque-captures 文件夹中。每个文件都附带构建、路线、模型以及影响画面的每项设置的记录，旁边的 .json 文件也记录相同内容。\n\n面向显示的帧保存为 PNG，线性 HDR 帧保存为 PFM（32 位浮点）。在 Present 路线上，它是绘制菜单之前的最终画面；在放大器之后，它是放大器的输出，位于游戏自身的色调映射、后处理和界面之前。\n\n保留最新的 64 对。在 OptiScaler 旁边放入名为 dlssnr-capture.trigger 的文件，可在 D3D12 路线上从游戏外部请求同样的捕获。
