Overrides the game's Vulkan present mode, the game recreates its swapchain to apply it.\n\nImmediate: no V-Sync, tears.\nMailbox: no tearing, newest frame replaces the queued one.\nFIFO: V-Sync.\nFIFO Relaxed: V-Sync, tears when below the refresh rate.\nFIFO Latest Ready: V-Sync, shows the newest ready frame at each refresh.\n\nMailbox and FIFO Latest Ready can drop generated frames above the refresh rate.\nOnly modes the display supports are listed.	覆盖游戏的 Vulkan 呈现模式，游戏会重建其交换链以应用。\n\nImmediate：无 V-Sync，有画面撕裂。\nMailbox：无撕裂，最新帧替换队列中的帧。\nFIFO：V-Sync。\nFIFO Relaxed：V-Sync，低于刷新率时会撕裂。\nFIFO Latest Ready：V-Sync，每次刷新时显示最新就绪的帧。\n\n高于刷新率时，Mailbox 和 FIFO Latest Ready 可能丢弃生成的帧。\n仅列出显示器支持的模式。
